        "filing_date": "2026-02-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2023, we began deploying our newest offering, AIP, which is designed for customers across the commercial and government sectors, enabling them to derive value from recent breakthroughs in AI via the combination of our existing software platforms with generative AI models, including LLMs.",
